              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thus, when you give alms, sound no trumpet before you, as the hypocrites do in the synagogues and in the streets, that they may be praised by men. Truly, I say to you, they have received their reward. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when you give alms, do not let your left hand know what your right hand is doing, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.23+COL.3.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Col 3.23-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " so that your alms may be in secret; and your Father who sees in secret will reward you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
